  classDef later fill:#fff,stroke:#FF7A59,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#1F2A37
  classDef start fill:#F6E7CF,stroke:#1F2A37,color:#1F2A37

  A[Splash]:::start --> B[Choose language<br/>العربية / English]:::start
