  TB[[Bottom tab bar]]:::start
  TB --> H
  TB --> CAL
  TB --> SUP
  TB --> EXP
  TB --> FAM

  H((Home)):::tab
  CAL((Calendar)):::tab
  SUP((Supplies)):::tab
